+*   **Out-of-Bounds Access:** The method relies on implicit clipping to the viewport [S1, unofficial]. If the depth buffer does not return zero for out-of-bounds accesses, the iteration may not terminate correctly [S1, unofficial].
 
 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** The method performs a fixed number of steps up to `maxSteps` or `maxDistance`. Each step involves simple arithmetic operations (FMUL) and a texture lookup [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Minimal additional memory is required beyond the depth buffer. The algorithm is designed to minimize register count and instruction cache pressure [S1, unofficial].
